  "text": "Skip to content\nHome\nMachinery\nSpare Parts\nThe Firm\nResources\nContact Us\nL55-B5 wheel loader\n\nTotal Power(kw) : 162kw\n\nOperating weight : 18270kg\n\nBucket Capacity : (m³)\n\nREQUEST QUOTE\nWHATSAPP US\nPRODUCT DESCRIPTION\n\nTHE STANDARD LOADER L55-B5\n\nThe Shantui STANDARD LOADER L55-B5 redefines power, performance, and productivity.\n\nThis heavyweight champion boasts a 162kW Weichai engine and a massive 170kN breakout force, making it the ultimate weapon for construction, mining, and material handling. Reach new heights with the extended boom option, dumping materials with precision at a whopping 3410mm.\n\nBut it’s not just brute strength. The L55-B5 is built to work smarter, not harder. Its elegant design and precise controls navigate tight spaces with ease, while the spacious, comfortable cab keeps you focused and productive all day.\n\nHere’s what sets the L55-B5 apart:\n\nUnmatched power: Dominate any job site with the industry-leading engine and breakout force.\nExtended reach: Dump higher, reach further, and conquer any challenge with the optional boom extension.\nVersatility redefined: From standard buckets to quick-change attachments, the L55-B5 adapts to your needs.\nOperator comfort: Stay focused and productive in the spacious, ergonomically designed cab.\n\nEfficiency champion: Move more in less time with the L55-B5’s rapid cycle times.\n\nPrevious\nNext\nReady to Conquer Your Project?\n\nYour project deserves the best. Let us help you find the perfect solution. Contact us today for a personalized consultation and tailored quote.\n\nGet Your Quote Now!\n\nFill in this form and we’ll get back to you shortly.\n\nRequest Quick Quote\nSUBMIT\n\nWith leading brands like Shantui, Dynapac, Gehl, and Howo trucks in our corner, we offer a comprehensive machinery portfolio to tackle any construction challenge.\n\nQUICK LINKS\nHome\nProducts\nServices\nAbout Us\nMedia\nContact Us\nGET IN TOUCH\ninfo@prescott.co.ke\n0733-284-616\n0733-284-616\nAuthorised Shantui Machinery Dealers.\nFacebook-f\n \nInstagram\n \nTwitter\n \nLinkedin\n \nWhatsapp\n\nPrescott Engineering Solutions Limited. © All Rights Reserved.",
